{{#> container}}
{{#*inline "email-content"}}
<tr>
  <td class="para txt-light" style="padding-top: 1rem; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.3px; line-height: 1.3;">
    This is a gentle reminder that your runner
    <strong class="txt-light" style="color: #ffffff">{{runnerName}}</strong> added to your
    <strong class="txt-light" style="color: #ffffff">{{workspaceName}}</strong> is not accessible from Patr due to
    unknown reasons.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td class="para txt-light" style="padding-top: 1rem; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.3px; line-height: 1.3;">
    Verify whether the runner is in an active state from your cloud provider&#39;s dashboard.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td class="para txt-light" style="padding-top: 1rem; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.3px; line-height: 1.3;">
    If {{runnerName}} has already been deleted in the cloud provider, then mark it as deleted from the
    <a href="https://app.patr.cloud/runner/{{runnerId}}" class="plain-link txt-primary"
      style="color: #f89b41; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;">Patr dashboard</a> as well.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td class="para txt-light" style="padding-top: 1rem; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.3px; line-height: 1.3;">
    If the runner is not accessible in {{deadlineLimit}} days, then {{runnerName}} and the deployments made in
    that runner will be deleted in Patr.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td class="para txt-light" style="padding-top: 1rem; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.3px; line-height: 1.3;">
    If you are facing any issues, reach out to us at
    <a href="mailto:support@patr.cloud" class="plain-link txt-primary" title="Contact Patr support"
      style="color: #f89b41; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;">support@patr.cloud</a>
  </td>
</tr>
{{/inline}}
{{/container}}